# Concepts

Shared vocabulary for this workspace — entities, named processes, and status
concepts with project-specific meaning. **This is one of two files you author
yourself** (the other is `docs/context-source-ladder.md`); everything else in the
support tree installs verbatim.

Seeded below with the workspace-pattern vocabulary the kit ships, then accretes as
your team documents learnings. Direct edits are fine. Glossary only — not a spec,
not a catch-all. It is read often, so keep entries to a few sentences and move
detail into a `docs/solutions/` file or a Context Fabric record.

